---
layout: base.njk
title: Standing desks, lamps and small calm things
description: Serene Desk sells standing desks, desk lamps and small accessories for the room you work in.
bodyClass: home
---
{% import "art.njk" as a %}
<section class="hero gut" id="hero">
  <input type="checkbox" id="pull" class="vh" aria-label="Pull the lamp chain to warm the light">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="hero-copy">
      <p class="label">Standing desks · lamps · small calm things</p>
      <h1>Work, but <em>quieter.</em></h1>
      <p class="lede">Desks and accessories for the room you work in, designed to keep the noise down and your attention where you put it.</p>
      <div class="cta"><a class="btn lamp" href="{{ '/desks/' | url }}">Shop desks</a><a class="btn ghost" href="{{ '/guides/choosing-a-desk-width/' | url }}">Find your size</a></div>
    </div>
    <div class="scene-wrap grain">
      <svg class="scene" viewBox="0 0 520 400" role="img" aria-label="Illustration of an oak standing desk with a monitor, a glowing lamp and a plant. The lamp has a pull chain.">
        <defs>
          <radialGradient id="glow" cx="72%" cy="38%" r="55%"><stop offset="0" stop-color="#F3C26B" stop-opacity=".5"/><stop offset=".5" stop-color="#F3C26B" stop-opacity=".1"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#F3C26B" stop-opacity="0"/></radialGradient>
          <radialGradient id="glow2" cx="72%" cy="38%" r="48%"><stop offset="0" stop-color="#FFB45A" stop-opacity=".6"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#FFB45A" stop-opacity="0"/></radialGradient>
        </defs>
        <rect width="520" height="400" fill="#232C37"/>
        <rect class="pool" width="520" height="400" fill="url(#glow)"/>
        <rect class="pool warm" width="520" height="400" fill="url(#glow2)"/>
        <rect x="0" y="330" width="520" height="70" fill="#1B222B"/>
        <rect x="60" y="72" width="120" height="160" rx="4" fill="none" stroke="#3A4756" stroke-width="2"/>
        <path d="M60 152 H180 M120 72 V232" stroke="#3A4756" stroke-width="2"/>
        <rect x="140" y="180" width="300" height="12" rx="2" fill="#C99A68"/>
        <rect x="140" y="192" width="300" height="4" fill="#A97F52"/>
        <rect x="168" y="196" width="14" height="128" fill="#5B6878"/><rect x="398" y="196" width="14" height="128" fill="#5B6878"/>
        <rect x="150" y="322" width="50" height="8" rx="4" fill="#5B6878"/><rect x="380" y="322" width="50" height="8" rx="4" fill="#5B6878"/>
        <rect x="200" y="160" width="120" height="20" rx="2" fill="#8F6C49"/>
        <rect x="210" y="92" width="100" height="64" rx="3" fill="#121821"/><rect x="214" y="96" width="92" height="56" rx="2" fill="#2A3644"/>
        <rect x="224" y="108" width="50" height="4" rx="2" fill="#9DB4A3" opacity=".7"/><rect x="224" y="118" width="70" height="4" rx="2" fill="#9AA6B0" opacity=".5"/><rect x="224" y="128" width="40" height="4" rx="2" fill="#9AA6B0" opacity=".5"/>
        <rect x="255" y="156" width="10" height="6" fill="#121821"/>
        <path d="M352 120 L396 120 L386 96 L362 96 Z" fill="#C99A68"/><rect x="372" y="120" width="4" height="58" fill="#5B6878"/><ellipse cx="374" cy="178" rx="14" ry="3" fill="#5B6878"/><ellipse cx="374" cy="121" rx="12" ry="3" fill="#F3C26B"/>
        <path class="beam" d="M352 122 L330 178 L418 178 L396 122 Z" fill="#F3C26B"/>
        <g class="chain"><path d="M364 121 V152" stroke="#9AA6B0" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-dasharray="2 2"/><circle cx="364" cy="156" r="4" fill="#F3C26B"/></g>
        <rect x="330" y="166" width="16" height="14" rx="3" fill="#C99A68"/>
        <path d="M156 180 q-6 -30 6 -46 q4 22 -2 46 M162 180 q4 -26 20 -36 q-6 20 -14 36" fill="#7E9A87"/><rect x="150" y="166" width="22" height="14" rx="3" fill="#4C5A55"/>
        <text x="458" y="372" fill="#9AA6B0" font-family="IBM Plex Mono, monospace" font-size="11" text-anchor="end">38 dB motor · 25–51 in height</text>
      </svg>
      <label class="chain-hit" for="pull"><span class="vh">Pull the chain</span></label>
      {# margin note: pen-stroke arrow toward the chain, no text #}
      <svg class="note-arrow" viewBox="0 0 90 70" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 8 C 30 4, 60 14, 70 52" fill="none" stroke="#F3C26B" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M58 42 L70 55 L77 38" fill="none" stroke="#F3C26B" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="strip gut" aria-label="Key facts"><div class="wrap">
  <div class="fact"><p class="num">38<small>dB</small></p><p>Lift motor at full speed. Quieter than a library reading room.</p></div>
  <div class="fact"><p class="num">25–51<small>in</small></p><p>Height range, so it fits people from 5'0" to 6'6", sitting or standing.</p></div>
  <div class="fact"><p class="num">30<small>nights</small></p><p>Try any desk at home. If it isn't right, we pick it up.</p></div>
</div></section>

<section class="shop gut"><div class="wrap">
  <div class="shop-head"><h2>The quiet <em>essentials</em></h2><a class="seeall" href="{{ '/desks/' | url }}">Browse all desks</a></div>
  <div class="grid">
    {% for p in products %}{% if p.id in ["SD-DSK-STL","SD-LGT-LNT","SD-ACC-MAT","SD-ACC-CUB"] %}
      {% include "card.njk" %}
    {% endif %}{% endfor %}
  </div>
</div></section>

<section class="quiet gut" id="hour-cube"><div class="wrap">
  <div>
    <p class="label">The Hour Cube</p>
    <h2>Turn it over. <em class="ul">Start.</em></h2>
    <svg class="underline" viewBox="0 0 180 14" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 9 C 40 3, 90 12, 177 5" fill="none" stroke="#F3C26B" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
    <p>Each face is a work block: 25, 50 or 90 minutes. No app, no screen, no notifications. When the time's up it glows once and goes dark.</p>
    <p class="mono faces">Faces: 25 min · 50 min · 90 min</p>
    <a class="btn ghost" href="{{ '/products/hour-cube-timer/' | url }}">See the Hour Cube Timer</a>
  </div>
  <div class="cube-stage grain">
    <button type="button" class="cube" id="cube" data-face="1" aria-label="Hour Cube showing 50 minutes. Press to turn to the next face.">
      <span class="cube-in">
        <span class="face f25"><i>25</i><b>min</b></span>
        <span class="face f50"><i>50</i><b>min</b></span>
        <span class="face f90"><i>90</i><b>min</b></span>
        <span class="face fmark"><svg width="46" height="46" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#mark"/></svg></span>
      </span>
    </button>
    <svg class="note-arrow cube-arrow" viewBox="0 0 90 70" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M84 8 C 56 2, 28 16, 20 54" fill="none" stroke="#F3C26B" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M8 40 L20 56 L32 42" fill="none" stroke="#F3C26B" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
  </div>
</div></section>
